# Local backend secrets belong in .dev.vars (ignored by Git).
# D1 DB is configured as a Wrangler binding, not a connection string.
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is public and configured in wrangler.jsonc.
# Copy to .dev.vars and set the secret to enable local Google login.
# Register http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/auth/callback/google in Google Cloud.
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
